{
    "theme": "尋找物品",
    "data": {
        "phase1": [
            {
                "text": "今天家裡要辦婚禮，很多親戚都來了。<br>看到大家忙得不可開交，主角決定要幫大家一起準備。"
            },
            {
                "text": "Madia’ sala ca kitlumaq it tina ha’an lumaq haip diqanin.",
                "textCh": "媽媽今天家裡來了好多親戚哦！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923964",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Pasiza’ ca tuqasnanaz haip tu diqanin, daqat madia’ sala ca bunun maipa ti’.",
                "textCh": "今天是哥哥的婚禮，所以有很多人來。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923965",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Mantan manahip sala ca is’ang, talbuntun nii’ tu pasaduu nai.",
                "textCh": "好開心喔！很久沒有看到他們了！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923966",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Uu qana ! mu’amin ca bunun uka’ is inul’uan haip, asakas tu mindangaz is duma’.",
                "textCh": "對啊！今天大家都會很忙，你要幫忙大家。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923967",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Uu na, pasimaupakak tuza’!",
                "textCh": "好的，我一定會！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923968",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Na palasanucak is cukau’un a mama’az it unin.",
                "textCh": "我要去準備等一下要用的東西了。",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923969",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Kadangaz azak!",
                "textCh": "我來幫忙！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923970",
                "image": "girl.png",
                "background": "1-1.png"
            },
            {
                "text": "Malavia zakun maipa dii!",
                "textCh": "好，你跟我來！",
                "sound": "text/sound/66185/923971",
                "image": "mom.png",
                "background": "1-2.png"
            }
        ],
